    "text": "By White River Now ,\n12 hours ago An award-winning novelist and short story writer whose fiction has drawn comparisons in The New York Times will bring her work to a small Arkansas college campus this week, offering a rare free public event for regional readers. Mary Troy, recipient of the 2025 Leila Lenore Heasley Prize for Fiction... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
